{
  "info": {
    "name": "Smart Parking Management System (SPMS)",
    "description": "REST API collection for the SPMS microservices.\n\nPhase 1 includes infrastructure checks for the Eureka Service Registry. Phase 2 adds Config Server configuration endpoints and the API Gateway (routing + gateway actuator). Phase 3 adds the User Service (registration, login, profiles, booking-history placeholder) - both direct (8081) and via the API Gateway (8080). Phase 3 also adds the Vehicle Service (registration, update, list, delete, simulated entry/exit) - both direct (8082) and via the API Gateway (8080). Endpoints for Parking and Payment services will be added as they are implemented.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
